This is a plugin using the Advanced Filters extensible dropdown filter system. It adds a furnishing material filter that can be accessed when Materials >> All is selected.

This add-on is intended only as a stopgap until integrated functionality (a new filter button) is (hopefully) added to Advanced Filters.